<title>CHINA: Shanghai Phoenix to offer no dividend.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Phoenix to offer no dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of bicycle maker Shanghai Phoenix Co have approved a company proposal to offer no returns to investors for the fiscal year 1996, a company statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The decision was made after the company posted a net loss of 93.52 million yuan in 1996 against a net profit of 25.37 million yuan in 1995 due to a weak domestic market, the statement said.</p>
